{"id":22,"title":"赠汪伦","dynasty":"唐","author":"李白","lines":[{"text":"李白乘舟将欲行，","pinyin":"lǐ bái chéng zhōu jiāng yù xíng","chars":[{"char":"李","pinyin":"lǐ"},{"char":"白","pinyin":"bái"},{"char":"乘","pinyin":"chéng"},{"char":"舟","pinyin":"zhōu"},{"char":"将","pinyin":"jiāng"},{"char":"欲","pinyin":"yù"},{"char":"行","pinyin":"xíng"},{"char":"，","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"忽闻岸上踏歌声。","pinyin":"hū wén àn shàng tà gē shēng","chars":[{"char":"忽","pinyin":"hū"},{"char":"闻","pinyin":"wén"},{"char":"岸","pinyin":"àn"},{"char":"上","pinyin":"shàng"},{"char":"踏","pinyin":"tà"},{"char":"歌","pinyin":"gē"},{"char":"声","pinyin":"shēng"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"桃花潭水深千尺，","pinyin":"táo huā tán shuǐ shēn qiān chǐ","chars":[{"char":"桃","pinyin":"táo"},{"char":"花","pinyin":"huā"},{"char":"潭","pinyin":"tán"},{"char":"水","pinyin":"shuǐ"},{"char":"深","pinyin":"shēn"},{"char":"千","pinyin":"qiān"},{"char":"尺","pinyin":"chǐ"},{"char":"，","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"不及汪伦送我情。","pinyin":"bù jí wāng lún sòng wǒ qíng","chars":[{"char":"不","pinyin":"bù"},{"char":"及","pinyin":"jí"},{"char":"汪","pinyin":"wāng"},{"char":"伦","pinyin":"lún"},{"char":"送","pinyin":"sòng"},{"char":"我","pinyin":"wǒ"},{"char":"情","pinyin":"qíng"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]}],"titlePinyin":["zèng","wāng","lún"]}